          "text": "of whose waist garment touches the head of S'iva, and which",
          "end": "space"
        },
        {
          "n": 5,
          "text": "with good fruits and with the barks of the trees lining",
          "end": "space"
        },
        {
          "n": 6,
          "text": "its bank furnishes a splendid living, what wise man is there,",
          "end": "space"
        },
        {
          "n": 7,
          "text": "who, with the intense pain from the fever of poverty, would",
          "end": "space"
        },
        {
          "n": 8,
          "text": "face harrowing miseries, if he had no commiseration for his",
          "end": "space"
        },
        {
          "n": 9,
          "text": "ill-placed family ?",
          "end": "space"
