          "n": 2,
          "text": "full of happiness ) to a man who is poor, self-restrained,",
          "end": "space"
        },
        {
          "n": 3,
          "text": "peaceful, of an equilibrating mind, and ever content at heart.",
          "end": "space"
        }
      ],
      "uncertain": false,
      "note": null
    },
